WEBVTT

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:17.190
Go, Stardust Dragon!

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.590
Shooting Sonic!

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:32.390
Good.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.620
I'm finally free from dueling.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:41.650
Lotten!

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:47.280
Enjoy your trip to hell, Yusei Fudo.

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:56.790
Didn't we put Yusei Fudo's 
D-Wheel over there?

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:58.830
I don't remember.

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:01.070
Hmm...

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:06.400
Just in case, I'll finish them.

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:10.190
Kiryu.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:12.700
Leave me alone.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:16.080
I died.

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:23.200
I won't let you die.

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:27.430
Even if I die, I'm bringing you home.

00:01:47.990 --> 00:01:53.120
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:58.630
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:03.100
Don't look back and keep going

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:08.940
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:13.910
There's no need to fear

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:21.590
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:27.560
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:33.330
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:38.740
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:46.840
And will lead you to a bright place

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:18.940
Fearsome Gatling Ogre

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:26.450
I know Yusei will free 
Kiryu from the mountain.

00:03:26.770 --> 00:03:29.650
He's also in Team Satisfaction!

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:32.760
Let's hurry and deliver him his D-Wheel.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:35.200
They'll need it to escape from town.

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.070
Yeah!

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:04.120
Now's our chance.  Let's go!

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:09.960
Kiryu, I'll do whatever it 
takes to bring you with me.

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:15.430
Yusei...  You...

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:19.830
How many will pass out today?

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:20.830
I predict eight people.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:36.320
There's a breeze.  We're close.

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:45.590
We escaped.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:47.190
Kiryu!

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:54.630
I told you to leave me alone!

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:55.270
Kiryu!

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:22.090
This graveyard is filled with people 
who were brought to the mountain.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:47.220
These people died because of me.

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:48.970
Kiryu, stop it.

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:51.130
Don't blame yourself.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:53.260
It's the truth.

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:57.100
The people who lost their duels 
were sent to the mountain.

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:59.760
It's the same as if I killed them!

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:06.180
Kiryu...

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:12.640
West!  Nico!

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:14.610
Kiryu!

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:15.610
Kiryu!

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:20.180
Why do you have Yusei's D-Wheel?

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:24.460
Since you're both in Team 
Satisfaction, I knew you'd be okay!

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:28.190
Kiryu and Yusei, please use 
this D-Wheel to escape.

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:29.990
Don't be foolish.

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:33.160
Why would you put yourselves 
in danger for me?

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:36.440
Because you're not meant to be in this town.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.800
Because you're West's cherished hero.

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:42.230
And mine too.

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:50.180
But there's someone you want 
to rescue more than me.

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:52.440
I know.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:57.170
But for now, we can rescue you.

00:06:57.570 --> 00:06:59.420
Someone they want to rescue?

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:04.880
That's my dad's pendant!

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:06.300
What?

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:06.970
Let me see!

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:08.220
It's dad's!

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:09.120
You're right!

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:12.700
Yusei, did you meet our dad?  Was he okay?

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:14.280
Yeah.

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.440
He wasn't at the work site.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:25.240
I'm going to become as strong 
as Kiryu and rescue my dad!

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:29.120
Kiryu, take my D-Wheel.

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:30.720
Descend the mountain alone.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:34.190
What?  Why just me?

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:35.460
Are you going to-

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:38.570
I'll rescue the people who 
were sent to the mine.

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:43.900
I can help them because I 
can remove their collars.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:46.940
Yusei, you were planning this from the start.

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:48.680
Go, Kiryu.

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:52.670
The kids and I made it this far 
because we wanted to rescue you.

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:56.040
We won't let you die here.

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:58.930
So Kiryu, please.

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:04.160
Why are you doing this for 
someone as worthless as me?

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:08.940
That's...

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:14.060
I knew you couldn't be dealt 
with by ordinary means.

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:16.970
I'll finish you in an instant.

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:19.370
Don't let them escape from 
the mountain!  Corner them!

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:20.300
Gotcha!

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:21.560
Kiryu, take them!

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.880
You two, this way!

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:39.020
Bring it!  I'll take you on!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:42.160
Interesting.  I'll crush you.

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:50.970
You're like a trapped rat.  Give up.

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:52.710
I challenge you to a duel!

00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:55.310
Fine with me.

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:58.740
Field Spell Speed World 2 set on!

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:01.040
Duel Mode on.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:05.810
Riding Duel!  Acceleration!

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:10.840
I'll go first.

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.170
My turn!

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:17.660
I summon Gatling Ogre!

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:24.320
That's...

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:36.350
On the first turn, that monster 
executed the One Turn Kill.

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:40.180
It deals 800 points of damage for every 
set card it sends to the graveyard.

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:46.060
I send Effect Veiler from my hand to 
the graveyard to activate its effect!

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:53.280
Your monster's effect is 
negated until the End Phase!

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:56.750
He stopped my first turn One Turn Kill!

00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:58.180
However...

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.440
I set five cards!

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.070
He loaded his bullets.

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:10.300
I end my turn.

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:20.630
Damn!

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:25.530
My turn!

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:33.000
Gatling Ogre has a fearsome effect.

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:35.410
But it only has 800 attack points.

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:38.480
I'll Synchro Summon to get the advantage!

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:41.210
I send one monster in my 
hand to the graveyard.

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:45.540
That lets me Special Summon the 
Tuner Monster Quickdraw Synchron!

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:55.050
I can use this monster as Synchro Material in 
place of a Tuner Monster with Synchron in its name.

00:10:57.620 --> 00:11:02.290
If you summon additional monsters in 
this narrow tunnel, it'll be too tight.

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:05.320
I won't let you Synchro Summon.

00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:08.680
I activate the Continuous Trap Narrow Tunnel!

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:14.140
Both players can only summon one monster.

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:16.680
If there are more than one 
monster on the field, you

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:19.220
have to destroy them until 
there's only one monster left.

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:25.340
My Synchro Material monster is now 
pointless, and I can't summon any more monsters.

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:30.570
The situation is the same for him, 
but he has Gatling Ogre's effect.

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:34.270
He activated his Continuous 
Trap, and he has four set cards.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:41.630
He can't do his One Turn Kill, but he'll 
defeat me if he sets one card next turn.

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:45.580
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:53.690
It all depends on his next draw!

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:11.010
I'm sorry, Kiryu.

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:12.240
Why?

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:14.470
It's our fault.

00:12:14.470 --> 00:12:17.360
Don't apologize.  It's not your fault.

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:19.740
This is my fight.

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:25.650
I won't let anyone hurt you 
because this doesn't concern you!

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:31.490
Damn!

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:35.530
Run over there!

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:50.380
Damn!

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:51.710
We won't let you escape!

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:57.660
My turn!

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.280
Is it a trap or Speed Spell?

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:05.900
It wasn't!  But...

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:11.900
I can't fire every bullet, but you'll 
still take four shots from Gatling Ogre!

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:14.420
Gatling Fire!

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:23.770
I escaped instant death, but 
I lost 3200 life points.

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:25.980
What an incredible monster.

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:28.980
I release Gatling Ogre!

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:31.950
What?  Why would you release Gatling Ogre?

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.690
I Tribute Summon Full Armor Ogre!

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:44.200
The scenario for victory is now complete.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:48.640
Your skills gave me trouble, 
but you've reached your end.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:52.350
Full Armor Ogre attacks Quickdraw Synchron!

00:13:57.510 --> 00:14:00.370
Full Armor Ogre has 1600 attack points.

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:03.070
If the attack succeeds, I'll 
run out of life points!

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:04.450
Fire!

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:10.020
I activate the trap card Desperate Tag!

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:15.070
When my monster is destroyed in 
battle, battle damage becomes 0.

00:14:15.070 --> 00:14:20.070
Then I can Special Summon one Level 
4-or-below Warrior-Type monster from my hand!

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:22.770
Appear, Max Warrior!

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:30.010
But there's still the bullet.

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:35.460
I activate Full Armor Ogre's effect.

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:40.450
When it destroys a monster in battle, 
you take 1000 points of damage!

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:43.590
I flip over the trap card Return Marker!

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:50.270
Once per turn, I can negate your monster's 
effect damage and destruction!

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:55.800
And you take damage equal to 
that monster's attack points!

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:56.960
What?

00:14:56.960 --> 00:15:00.040
Full Armor Ogre has 1600 attack points!

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:08.480
I end my turn.

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:11.610
I have 800 life points.

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:14.580
I've already surpassed Speed 
World 2's safety line.

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:17.350
If he gets 4 Speed Counters 
and a Speed Spell, I'll

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:22.610
take 800 points of damage, and 
my life points will drop to 0.

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:29.100
That's right.  I have multiple 
scenarios for victory.

00:15:46.490 --> 00:15:49.040
I'll slice that mine cart in half!

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:50.960
Damn!  Don't come any closer!

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:51.990
Go away!

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:54.590
You punk kids!

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.800
Take this!

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.340
Move!  Watch out!

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:04.100
Damn!

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:05.250
We did it!

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:08.230
Stop it!  Stay behind me!

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:10.360
No!  We're going to fight too!

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:12.840
We're going to help you escape!

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:15.370
I also want to save you!

00:16:15.560 --> 00:16:19.720
Why would you go this far for me?

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:27.450
I learned from you by 
watching you battle in town.

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:33.480
No matter how hard it is to 
rescue my dad, my wishes will

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:39.450
come true if I don't give up and 
keep battling like you, Kiryu!

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:43.700
Infernity Doom Dragon 
attacks Stardust Dragon.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.610
Death Fire Blast!

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:50.330
That's why I want you to fight again, Kiryu.

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:52.250
I want you to keep fighting!

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:53.370
You're wrong.

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:55.640
I wasn't fighting.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:58.580
My heart was always dead.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:00.250
You were watching an illusion.

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:02.380
You're wrong!

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:06.580
I also believe, just like my brother.

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:15.040
Playtime is over!

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:22.450
Kiryu, they'll catch up 
if you apply the brakes!

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:31.230
Hooray!

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:32.280
Kiryu.

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:35.480
But I'm fighting right now.

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:38.660
I'm fighting to live.

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:42.050
Kiryu!

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:43.270
What's that?

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:11.850
Hey!

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:14.710
Don't fight back!

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:17.720
He removed his collar!

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:21.710
Try anything funny and I'll 
shoot you with this shock gun!

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:22.470
Stand up!

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:33.560
This is another work site.

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:43.340
Kiryu.

00:18:43.570 --> 00:18:44.850
Kiryu.

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:47.260
When I give you the signal, run.

00:18:47.260 --> 00:18:49.740
There's another mine cart 
at the end of the rail.

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:51.060
Get in and escape.

00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:52.850
What about you, Kiryu?

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:57.020
Just think about staying alive.

00:18:57.130 --> 00:19:00.130
I'll take care of myself!

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:01.880
You punk!

00:19:01.880 --> 00:19:02.620
Run!

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:05.810
Go!

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:14.760
Get in, West!  Nico!

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:16.980
What are you doing?

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:22.780
West...  Nico...

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:24.670
Dad!

00:19:24.980 --> 00:19:26.270
Dad!

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:31.300
That's their father?

00:19:34.070 --> 00:19:36.230
Hurry up and get in the mine cart!

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:37.460
But dad is...

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:39.020
You two need to escape!

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:41.420
No!  We finally found you!

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:43.340
I'm sorry, Kiryu.

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:46.890
We can't leave dad behind.

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.890
Then everyone's coming!

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:50.260
Follow me!

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:03.170
Damn!

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:05.310
Bring the D-Wheels!  We're going after them!

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:13.670
They're coming!

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:15.460
They're persistent!

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:17.810
We'll be fine.

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:22.800
I'll fight and rescue this family.

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:27.330
My turn!

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:33.930
I release the Warrior-Type monster Max 
Warrior to Special Summon Turret Warrior!

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:42.410
Turret Warrior gains attack points equal 
to the released monster's attack points!

00:20:42.810 --> 00:20:45.540
Max Warrior has 1800 attack points!

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:48.900
Therefore, Turret Warrior's 
attack points become 3000!

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:49.960
What?

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:53.190
Turret Warrior attacks Full Armor Ogre!

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:54.790
Revolver Shot!

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:06.250
But when Full Armor Ogre is destroyed,

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:10.910
I can Special Summon Gatling 
Ogre from my graveyard!

00:21:14.470 --> 00:21:16.110
Gatling Ogre...

00:21:16.310 --> 00:21:17.290
I end my turn.

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:20.390
I'll have 4 Speed Counters next turn.

00:21:20.390 --> 00:21:25.720
Since you're past the safety line, I'll shoot 
and defeat you the moment I draw a Speed Spell.

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:31.160
And if I draw a trap card, Gatling 
Ogre's effect will end you.

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:35.090
In other words, my draw 
is like a dynamite's fuse.

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:13.210
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:13.210 --> 00:22:18.220
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:23.120
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:23.120 --> 00:22:28.130
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:28.330 --> 00:22:33.000
The cruel god tests us

00:22:33.300 --> 00:22:39.940
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:39.940 --> 00:22:43.810
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:43.810 --> 00:22:49.650
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:49.810 --> 00:22:53.550
Bond is the proper word

00:22:53.550 --> 00:22:59.520
As we fight, we understand each other

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:02.490
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:02.490 --> 00:23:04.730
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:04.730 --> 00:23:09.400
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:12.270
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:12.270 --> 00:23:15.710
You want to party until the morning

00:23:15.710 --> 00:23:18.980
At our special place
